  "identifier": "cellvit",
  "name": "CellViT",
  "alternateName": [
    "CellViT++"
  ],
  "description": "Vision Transformer-based framework for precise nucleus instance segmentation and classification in whole-slide histology images. U-Net encoder-decoder architecture with pretrained ViT encoders. Achieves state-of-the-art panoptic quality on PanNuke (pan-cancer, 19 tissue types). Supports gigapixel WSI inference. Original CellViT superseded by CellViT++ (TIO-IKIM/CellViT-plus-plus). Published in Medical Image Analysis 2024. 380 stars (original) + 204 stars (CellViT++). Developed at IKIM (Institute for AI in Medicine), University Hospital Essen. Note: licensed under Apache 2.0 with Commons Clause — commercial use restricted.",
  "url": "https://github.com/TIO-IKIM/CellViT",
  "codeRepository": "https://github.com/TIO-IKIM/CellViT",
  "relatedLink": [
    "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.media.2024.103143",
    "https://github.com/TIO-IKIM/CellViT-plus-plus"
  ],
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
  "dateModified": "2025-07-23",
